# Pass "avec-ads2": the minimal set, plus the one optional mod this mod is compatible with.
#
# sambucher.adogsaidanimalprosthetics2, Workshop 3238353862 - A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2. About.xml
# names it in loadBefore, and Mod/Patches/AnimalProsthetics2.xml lists the beetle in that mod's categories,
# guarded by its name. Feature 15 asserts that the beetle ends up offered more recipes than the seraph, which
# is what a working patch, applied before that mod's own copy of the category lists, produces.
#
# The item is in the Windows Workshop folder and in the WSL cache (found 2026-09-25), no download needed.
#
# THE ORDER OF THE LINES IS THE LOAD ORDER. The staging activates the mod under test after every mod of the
# map, and it does not sort by loadBefore. The first run of this pass (request 3af4, 2026-09-25) therefore
# loaded Animal Prosthetics 2 BEFORE this mod: that mod copies its category lists into its surgeries with its
# own patch, ran first, and the beetle was offered the same 26 recipes as the seraph. The pass has to say what
# About.xml says, so this mod is named here, from its folder, ahead of the other one. The staging then sees it
# is already active and does not add it a second time (stage-pickle-wsl.sh, "overlay replaces").
#
# The two tools of the minimal set stay, so that the same features can be selected by filter; the language
# pass features do not run here (see the command in README.md).
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs   path:PickleTools/InspectTabs/Mod
nelim.pickletools.research      path:PickleTools/ResearchSteps/Mod
nelim.acertainseriescreaturesandhairrenew   path:ACertainSeriesCreaturesAndHairRenew/Mod
sambucher.adogsaidanimalprosthetics2   3238353862
